Every taper-team-member can support a clinician during an opioid-taper through a telephone-contact.
Every taper-team-member can support a patient during an opioid-taper through a telephone-contact.
Every taper-team-member can support a clinician during an opioid-taper through a telehealth-visit.
Every taper-team-member can support a patient during an opioid-taper through a telehealth-visit.
Every taper-team-member can support a clinician during an opioid-taper through a face-to-face-visit.
Every taper-team-member can support a patient during an opioid-taper through a face-to-face-visit.
A taper-team-member-example includes a nurse-example and includes a pharmacist-example and includes a behavioral-health-professional-example.
